            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"age_group = \" /><text value=\"&quot;twenty-five to thirty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = age_group.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;thirty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;thirty-five&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"twenty-five to thirty-five\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">da venticinque a trentacinque</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">da venticinque a trenta</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">da venticinque a trentacinque.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Segui la sostituzione prima che venga stampato <code>updated</code>. Cosa compare nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"age_group = \" /><text value=\"&quot;twenty-five to thirty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = age_group.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;thirty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;thirty-five&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"twenty-five to thirty-five\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">da venticinque a trentacinque</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">da venticinque a trenta</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">da venticinque a trenta-trentacinque</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">da venticinque a trentacinque.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question displaying",
            "id": 82746,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo riutilizzare il risultato restituito da <code>replace()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Creando una variabile e memorizzandola al suo interno</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo riutilizzare il risultato perché cambia sempre</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Creando una variabile e memorizzandola al suo interno.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Devi usare di nuovo una stringa aggiornata più avanti nel programma. Quale soluzione mantiene disponibile il risultato di <code>replace()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Memorizzare in una variabile il risultato restituito da replace()</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Chiamare replace() senza assegnarne il risultato</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Memorizzare di nuovo la stringa originale dopo aver chiamato replace()</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Memorizzare in una variabile il risultato restituito da replace().</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question no change",
            "id": 82747,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;The answer is Belgium&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = answer.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Belgium&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;Finland&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"The answer is Finland\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">La risposta è il Belgio</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">La risposta è Finlandia</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La risposta è Finlandia.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>replace()</code> restituisce una stringa aggiornata senza modificare la variabile originale.</p><p>Se aggiungi <code>answer = updated</code> dopo la sostituzione, quali valori contengono le due variabili?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;The answer is Belgium&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = answer.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Belgium&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;Finland&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"The answer is Finland\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sia answer sia updated contengono Finlandia</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">answer mantiene Belgio e updated contiene Finlandia</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">answer contiene Finlandia e updated mantiene Belgio</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sia answer sia updated contengono Finlandia.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
