          {
            "title": "Example: Replace",
            "id": 82750,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiorna la stringa chiamando <code>replace()</code> per correggere l'errore di maiuscole e minuscole</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;The answer is INcorrect&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = answer.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;INcorrect&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;incorrect&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"60\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"The answer is incorrect\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>answer</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>replace</code>, <code>\"incorrect\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Correggi le maiuscole affinché la console mostri <code>The answer is incorrect</code> con <code>incorrect</code> tutto minuscolo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;The answer is INcorrect&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updated = answer.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;INcorrect&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;incorrect&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(updated)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Incorrect&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"The answer is incorrect\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>answer</code>, seguito da <code>.</code>, <code>replace</code> e infine <code>\"incorrect\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
